# Patrimo harness

Before changing product behavior:

1. Read [CONSTRAINTS.md](CONSTRAINTS.md)
2. Read [docs/reference/glossary.md](docs/reference/glossary.md)
3. Read [PROGRESS.md](PROGRESS.md)
4. Read the colocated `ARCHITECTURE.md` for the package you touch

## Stop criteria

- Do not declare a task done without green `make verify` (lint + typecheck + unit tests).
- Work one [FEATURES.md](FEATURES.md) item at a time.
- Do not invent sheet names, enums, or reserved IDs — use the glossary and `@patrimo/core`.
- Update PROGRESS.md at session end. Optional run log: `docs/agent/runs/`.

## Doc placement

Mechanics live next to code (`ARCHITECTURE.md`). Decisions live in `docs/adr/`. See [docs/DOC_MODEL.md](docs/DOC_MODEL.md).
